  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Butane Pilot Plant</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Butane-Pilot-Plant-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Modular system allows transport to remote locations</li>\n<li>Each module is the size of a 40 ft container</li>\n<li>Can be assembled in area of minimal infrastructure</li>\n<li>Liquefied butane removes oil from drill cuttings/mud</li>\n<li>Heat pump reduces energy consumption</li>\n<li>Recovered oil is fully reusable and is not thermally degraded</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Liquified Gasses</h3><ul><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/butane-pilot-plant/\">Butane Pilot Plant</a></li><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/dme-system-for-fiber-recycling/\">DME System for Fiber Recycling</a></li><li><a href=\"/supercritical-fluid-processing/liquefied-gases/propane-system/\">Propane System</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Butane-Pilot-Plant-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Butane-Pilot-Plant-b-300x257.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"257\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Butane-Pilot-Plant-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/HPFP-Butane-Pilot-Plant-a-185x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"185\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
